        ],
        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "lysira_round_in"
                        },
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "no_lysira_round_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 25,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Walk the round with her",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:sidequest/lysira/reward"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "claim_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Eight measures, dry and bright. Hold the ladder and mind your eyes — wisp-glass takes the dust all at once, like it has been holding its breath. Walk it with me. A round you have fed is a round you will trust after dark, and I want you trusting this one."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "There. Four lanterns, lit and fed, willow to willow. The mist is already sulking about it. Come here — the last one on the round is mine to show you."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Lysira — the round refilled",
                    Label: "claim"
                },
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "lysira_round_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 24,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Goodbye",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "goodbye_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The round held all night on your dust. Not one lamp guttered. That has not happened since before the fog turned mean, and I am telling everyone it was my technique."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Remember what I showed you. The last lamp on the round looks over the south dock, and I keep it brightest for a reason. The waters go down there. Lanterns only ever mind what goes down."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Lysira — the round holds",
                    Label: "done"
                },
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "badges_gte_3"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 20,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Tell me about the round",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add lysira_round_started"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "round_detail"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "help_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Staying in the light",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You have been down the boardwalk enough times to know the rule now — stay in the lantern-light and you stay whole. Step off it after dusk and the marsh introduces you to the things the mist was hiding. Four badges, five, it does not matter to a creeper in the reeds. The light does not care who you are either. It only cares that it is lit."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Every other town in this region snuffs its monsters at the gate. Not us. So I light. Sundown to sunup, willow to willow, and if I miss one, somebody does not make the shrine road. Keep to the flames."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Lysira — the lamplighter",
                    Label: "mid"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Tell me about the round",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add lysira_round_started"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "round_detail"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "help_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Not tonight",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Mind the lanterns, traveller. In this marsh the dark still bites — we are the one town foolish enough to let the mobs keep their spawns. The wisp-lamps down the boardwalk are the only sure road to the shrine after sundown, and the fog put four of mine out last night."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You look like you can hold a torch and a Pokeball at once. If you have got a spare hour and a spare nerve, I could use a hand relighting the round before the mist swallows the whole walk again."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Lysira — the lamplighter",
                    Label: "default"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Hand over 8 glowstone dust",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative turnin minecraft:glowstone_dust 8 lysira_round_in"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "dust_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "I will fetch the dust",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Four lanterns, in order, down the willows toward the shrine — and every one of them is starving. The wisp-glass burns glowstone, not wick. Eight measures of dust refills the whole round, and a fed lantern is the one argument the mist has never won."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Mind where you buy it. The Exchange sells glowstone at what they call the verified rate, which is the honest Nether price plus the cost of the word verified. Dig it or trade it, eight measures, and the boardwalk holds till dawn."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Lysira — the round",
                    Label: "round_detail"
                }
            ]
        },
